{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012a.q31.material.recovered", "text": "陈晓华系某学校的小学生。2011年10月10日，该学生数学测验考了85分，任课老师觉得他是马虎丢了分数，要当众打他手板，让他吸取这个教训。学习成绩一向很好的陈晓华不肯接受这个处罚，扭过身子，背对老师。这下可惹怒了老师，于是老师扬起教鞭照陈晓华的头部打去，陈晓华当即低下了头，又被打了一下，陈晓华的身体便软软地滑倒在课桌边。老师上来拎起他，只见他鼻子和口角往外流血。老师感觉事情不妙，赶快送往人民医院。经检查为脑室出血，陈晓华昏迷达六个月，在医生的精心治疗下病情有所好转。不幸的是，2012年3月20日上午，陈晓华因旧病复发，颅内大量出血，抢救无效而死亡。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "62edf0f0fa311b44e8d47bf523582fd228adb0e80f6daa0139732f93d66ac0d9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4108, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4385, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "62edf0f0fa311b44e8d47bf523582fd228adb0e80f6daa0139732f93d66ac0d9"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012a.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": [], "ability_ids": [], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012a.q31"], "word_count": 277, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "62edf0f0fa311b44e8d47bf523582fd228adb0e80f6daa0139732f93d66ac0d9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4108, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4385, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "62edf0f0fa311b44e8d47bf523582fd228adb0e80f6daa0139732f93d66ac0d9"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": "research_non_commercial", "expires_at": null, "source_nature": "official_exam", "nature_note": "教育主管部门公开发布的考试试题", "nature_evidence": "filename_pattern:官方真题命名", "attribution_required": false}}}
{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012a.q32.material.recovered", "text": "某日上午，没有完成作业的张靖被刘老师叫到讲桌前，然后刘老师向全班下达任务：“每个人去打5棍，谁打得不狠就打谁”。结果，全班有40名学生，除了另外4个没有做完作业的学生外，其余35名学生全部动了手，共打了张靖l75棍，刘老师也亲自动手打了5棍。挨打后，张靖疼痛难忍，还被要求坐着听课，直到放学。回家时，他走到家门口就瘫倒了。张母送他就医时发现其臀部大面积红肿，部分已经成了紫红色。几天后，张靖仍只能趴在病床上。张母说，儿子现在每天晚上只能趴着睡觉。“不趴着不行啊，屁股疼。晚上稍微碰着一点，都疼得喊‘妈啊，我屁股疼”’。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "62edf0f0fa311b44e8d47bf523582fd228adb0e80f6daa0139732f93d66ac0d9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4412, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4671, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "62edf0f0fa311b44e8d47bf523582fd228adb0e80f6daa0139732f93d66ac0d9"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012a.q32"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m1.k3", "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.ethics"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.201.r007", "ntce.outline.201.r008", "ntce.outline.201.r010", "ntce.outline.201.r011", "ntce.outline.201.r018", "ntce.outline.201.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012a.q32"], "word_count": 259, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "62edf0f0fa311b44e8d47bf523582fd228adb0e80f6daa0139732f93d66ac0d9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4412, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4671, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学