{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012a.q33.material.recovered", "text": "湖北省武汉市某小学六年级（3）班学生的差别很大，数学学习上学生的差别尤其大。如果按优秀学生的水平教学，中等以下水平的学生听不懂。如果按中等学生的水平教学，优秀学生会感觉太简单。该班数学老师说，按照素质教育的要求，今后按照班上最低水平教学。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "62edf0f0fa311b44e8d47bf523582fd228adb0e80f6daa0139732f93d66ac0d9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4703, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4822, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 33, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "62edf0f0fa311b44e8d47bf523582fd228adb0e80f6daa0139732f93d66ac0d9"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012a.q33"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m1.k1"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.ethics"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.201.r001", "ntce.outline.201.r002", "ntce.outline.201.r003"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012a.q33"], "word_count": 119, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "62edf0f0fa311b44e8d47bf523582fd228adb0e80f6daa0139732f93d66ac0d9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4703, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4822, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 33, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "62edf0f0fa311b44e8d47bf523582fd228adb0e80f6daa0139732f93d66ac0d9"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization